	quests: [
		{
			title: "Punch Wood, Meet Destiny"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
			subtitle: "Every myth starts somewhere"
			description: [
				"Welcome to \u00a76Mythic Prehistory\u00a7r."
				""
				"Long before the first hero strung a bow, the old world walked on claw and scale. This land never forgot. Dinosaurs still roam its valleys, harpies nest in its cliffs, and the gods still meddle in its weather."
				""
				"This book is your guide. Each chapter teaches one part of the pack, and most quests complete \u00a7bthemselves\u00a7r: kill the beast, stand in the biome, look at the creature, and the book notices."
				""
				"Rewards come three ways: items outright, \u00a7ba choice of one from several\u00a7r, or \u00a7da random draw from a loot crate\u00a7r. The rarer the crate, the wilder the odds."
				""
				"First: the oldest ritual. Craft a table and the book hands you the \u00a76Wanderer's Kit\u00a7r: a backpack, a spear, a rod with a lucky hook, a warp stone, a sleeping bag, a dragon cage, and a poacher's breakfast: dodo eggs, juniper berries, and two golden salads. Not power; a head start."
			]
			id: "000000000000001C"
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.5d
