		{
			title: "Open the Map, Drop a Pin"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 1.5d
			subtitle: "Terralith + Tectonic + Xaero's"
			description: [
				"Press \u00a7bM\u00a7r for Xaero's World Map; the minimap lives in the corner of your screen."
				""
				"This terrain is not vanilla. Terralith and Tectonic rebuilt the world with skylands, canyons, and hundred-block cliffs. Set a waypoint (\u00a7bB\u00a7r) at your spawn before you wander; you will not find it again by memory."
