		{
			title: "Type /sethome. Now."
			x: 2.0d
			y: 1.5d
			subtitle: "FTB Essentials"
			description: [
				"FTB Essentials gives you commands worthy of a demigod:"
				""
				"\u00a7b/sethome base\u00a7r then \u00a7b/home base\u00a7r to return."
				"\u00a7b/back\u00a7r returns you to where you died."
				"\u00a7b/rtp\u00a7r throws you somewhere random and far."
				""
				"Run /sethome now. Future-you, treed by a carnotaurus at dusk, says thanks."
			]
