		{
			title: "JEI: Every Recipe, One Search"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 3.5d
			subtitle: "JEI + Jade"
			description: [
				"Open your inventory. The panel on the right is \u00a7eJEI\u00a7r: every item in the pack."
				""
				"Hover anything: \u00a7bR\u00a7r shows its recipe, \u00a7bU\u00a7r shows what it makes. Type \u00a7b@shineals\u00a7r to see one mod's whole catalog."
				""
				"And look at any chest: \u00a7eJade\u00a7r shows its contents in the HUD without opening it. Craft a torch to prove you found the crafting screen."
			]
