		{
			title: "Craft a Backpack"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 3.5d
			subtitle: "Sophisticated Backpacks"
			description: [
				"A Sophisticated Backpack is portable storage that grows in stages. Upgrade the bag from leather to copper, iron, gold, diamond, then netherite; each tier earns its extra slots."
				""
				"Start with \u00a7bPickup + Filter\u00a7r for fossils and food. Add \u00a7bDeposit or Restock\u00a7r when your storage room exists. Magnet, automation, and large stack upgrades cost real materials, so the bag grows with your world instead of replacing progression on day one."
				""
				"Backpack enchantment books now explain themselves in their tooltips. JEI shows every upgrade recipe."
				""
				"You will fill it with fossils, fish, and dubious eggs soon enough."
			]
