		{
			title: "Die Once (You Keep Your Stuff)"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 5.0d
			subtitle: "Corpse + Ore Excavation + Carry On"
			description: [
				"When you die here, your body \u00a7bstays where it fell\u00a7r with everything on it. No despawn timer, no item scatter: walk back and loot yourself."
				""
				"Also learn these before you need them: hold the \u00a7bOre Excavation key\u00a7r (default ~) while mining to take a whole vein or tree at once, and \u00a7bpick up chests and creatures\u00a7r with an empty hand while sneaking (Carry On)."
				""
				"This quest asks the one thing every legend does eventually: die, and come back for your things."
